 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403758 1072 #uuid "96a85d0f-f840-5482-ab7d-823e5b207944" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403758 1074 "We compute the dot product between $u$ and each of the listed vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {v}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {v}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {v}_{4} \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-2)+(-1)\\cdot 1+3\\cdot 0+5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-4-1+0+5 \\\\  & =0.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot w & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {w}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {w}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {w}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {w}_{4} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot 4+3\\cdot (-1)+5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =2-4-3+5 \\\\  & =0.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot x & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {x}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {x}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {x}_{4} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot 0+3\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =4+0-6-5 \\\\  & =-7.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsequently, the correct option is $v$ and $w$ only." 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403760 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403761 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403762 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403763 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403764 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1077 "selection" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403762 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403759 1080 #uuid "a31d4961-a16e-58ba-afd9-33d1a3426a24" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403760 1081 "$w$ only" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403760 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403760 1084 #uuid "c7bba809-4721-5c7c-a