-6k+{k}^{2}+{k}^{2}-2k+1+4{k}^{2}+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6{k}^{2}-8k+14}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given equation  $\\text{d}(x,y)=2\\sqrt{3},$ we obtain an equation that we can solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{6{k}^{2}-8k+14} & =2\\sqrt{3} \\\\ {(\\sqrt{6{k}^{2}-8k+14})}^{2} & ={(2\\sqrt{3})}^{2} \\\\ 6{k}^{2}-8k+14 & =12 \\\\ 6{k}^{2}-8k+2 & =0 \\\\ 3{k}^{2}-4k+1 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the quadratic formula, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}k & =\\frac{-b\\pm \\sqrt{{b}^{2}-4ac}}{2a} \\\\  & =\\frac{-(-4)\\pm \\sqrt{(-4)^{2}-4(3)(1)}}{2(3)} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\pm \\sqrt{4}}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\pm 2}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\pm 1}{3},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives $k=1$ and $k=\\frac{1}{3}.$" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403767 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403768 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403769 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403770 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403771 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1077 "selection" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403769 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403766 1080 #uuid "e9b0cd10-86a5-5799-a64d-9f35511d1e34" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403767 1081 "k=\\pm 1" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403767 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403767 1084 #uuid "5eb8254f-2c6f-524e-99dd-34023e51e73a" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403768 1081 "k=\\pm 3" 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403768 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533493 17592186045585 true] [17592186403768 1084 #uuid "019fec80-5acc-501a-bef4-14b614fa816f" 1